      "degraded_success_rate": 0.34,
      "dominant_failure_code": "ISSUER_UNAVAILABLE",
      "dominant_share": 0.72,
      "note": "The headline event: one issuer's UPI rail degrades for twelve hours. Same decline codes a single customer would produce, concentrated in one corridor."
